  "body": "Beautifully finished and thoughtfully designed, this brand-new standalone home pairs contemporary elegance with the features families appreciate: five bedrooms, three bathrooms, a private garden and a double garage.\r\n\r\nSet at the rear of a boutique collection of just three homes, Lot 3 offers approximately 278sqm of land and 192sqm of floor area, including the garage. A refined palette, warm timber tones and stylish finishes create an inviting setting that feels effortlessly sophisticated.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, a sleek designer kitchen with a statement island connects with the dining and living spaces. Step outside to the generous deck and easy-care garden, a private haven for summer entertaining, leisurely morning coffees and relaxed family afternoons.\r\n\r\nA downstairs bedroom and full bathroom offer a welcoming option for extended family or guests. Upstairs, four bedrooms include an elegant master retreat with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite.\r\n\r\nA double garage and additional off-street parking provide excellent everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nClose to schools and Browns Bay's cafés, shops and restaurants, with Albany's extensive shopping precinct within easy reach, this home brings lifestyle and everyday convenience beautifully together.\r\n\r\nFresh design. Private outdoor living. Room for the whole family.\r\n\r\nContact Lily to arrange your private viewing.",
